This directory has all the inputs to your design (other than the RTL), such as:
- Library definitions
- SDC and MMMC definitions
- General DEFINE file for your design
- Floorplan inputs

Note that the files are purposely named "my-design.*", while the scripts all call "<toplevel>.*"
This is on purpose, so you will carefully edit (...rewrite) all of these files and rename them before use.
The examples provided are just templates for what your files could look like and could include.
